    LLM: "Identify the high filkÃ³ (OverndKnave of Acorns). If your team has it, you command the lead. Use it to protect your Tens and Aces.\n\nThe 'Partner Throw': If your partner leads an Ace, throw your Ten of the same suit onto it immediately. This secures 21 points instantly and builds towards the 61-point 'safe zone'.\n\nVoid Strategy: In FilkÃ³, the 'Must Trump' rule makes voids highy dangerous. If you know an opponent is void in Hearts, leading Hearts will bleed their trumps dry.",
